      "name": "1. Ascetics of Frost",
      "description": "Qiqi regenerates 2 Energy when the Herald of Frost hits an opponent marked by a Fortune-Preserving Talisman.\n{LINK#N11500004}Radiance: Stellar Glimmer{/LINK}: Qiqi also regenerates 6 Elemental Energy when the Herald of Frost's attacks and coordinated attacks hit opponents. This effect can trigger once every 6s."
